sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor C as Customer
    actor G as Warehouse Administrator
    participant UI as Browser UI
    participant M as MarketplaceService
    participant O as OrderRepository
    participant P as PaymentService
    C->>UI: Ajukan retur item beserta bukti
    UI->>M: requestReturn(detailId, evidence)
    M->>O: Ambil item, received_at, status, pemilik
    O-->>M: Data item dan waktu penerimaan
    alt Diajukan maksimal satu hari dan bukti tersedia
        M->>O: Simpan return_status requested
        M-->>UI: Menunggu tinjauan gudang
        G->>UI: Masukkan keputusan dan alasan
        UI->>M: decideReturn(detailId, decision)
        alt Disetujui
            M->>O: Simpan return_status approved
            M->>P: refund(originalPaymentId, amount)
            P-->>M: Hasil refund
            M->>O: Simpan refunded hanya bila refund berhasil
            M-->>UI: Tampilkan keputusan dan refund
        else Ditolak
            M->>O: Simpan return_status rejected
            M-->>UI: Tampilkan alasan penolakan
        end
    else Terlambat atau bukti kurang
        M-->>UI: Tolak permintaan retur
    end
    UI-->>C: Tampilkan status retur
